  "body": "Offering approximately 227m² of beautifully designed living on a 451m² freehold section, this brand-new family home combines exceptional space, outstanding flexibility, and the added confidence of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nDesigned with today’s growing and multi-generational families in mind, the thoughtfully planned layout features five generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, two separate living areas, and the rare advantage of two master suites—including a private ensuite bedroom on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and family living area creates the heart of the home, while the designer kitchen is finished with quality Bosch appliances, a large breakfast island, and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nThe ground-floor master suite offers outstanding flexibility, making it ideal for grandparents, extended family, guests, teenagers, or a private home office with its own ensuite.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second living room provides valuable additional family space and flows seamlessly onto a generous deck and backyard—perfect for entertaining, relaxing, or giving every family member room to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs master suite offers a peaceful retreat with its own ensuite, complemented by three further bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom.\r\n\r\nComfort is assured throughout with zoned central air-conditioning featuring individual room controls, while underfloor heating in the bathrooms provides extra warmth and luxury during the cooler months.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n• Freehold 451m² section\r\n\r\n• Approx. 227m² floor area\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Dual Master Suites, including one on the ground floor\r\n\r\n• Two Separate Living Areas\r\n\r\n• Upstairs lounge opening onto a large deck and backyard\r\n\r\n• Premium Bosch kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Zoned central air-conditioning with individual room controls\r\n\r\n• Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• CCC issued – Ready to Move In\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been searching for a home that offers true flexibility for extended families, extra living space for busy households, and the reassurance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, 242B West Hoe Heights delivers it all in one beautifully finished package.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa today to arrange your private viewing.",
